REM hello_world.duck - the simplest proof of life.
REM
REM HARMLESS: it waits for the host to settle, then types one line into
REM whatever window currently has focus, and presses Enter. It runs no
REM commands and changes nothing. Open a text editor on the target first so
REM you can see it type.
REM
REM Targets any OS (it just types characters). Only plug the device into
REM hardware you own or are authorized to test.

DELAY 800
STRINGLN Hello World! - typed by a BadHID device on your own lab machine.
